    {
      "field_name": "diagnostic_criteria",
      "value": "After obtaining written consent from the parents, DNA was extracted from the peripheral blood of the patient and genes involved in the glycinergic neurotransmission system were analyzed by PCR and direct sequencing. Aberrations in the GLRA1 or SLC6A5 genes were not observed but a compound heterozygote mutation was detected in the GLRB gene.",
      "quote": "After obtaining written consent from the parents, DNA was extracted from the peripheral blood of the patient and genes involved in the glycinergic neurotransmission system were analyzed by PCR and direct sequencing. Aberrations in the GLRA1 or SLC6A5 genes were not observed but a compound heterozygote mutation was detected in the GLRB gene.",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
